From 99f642f9ef6d6e93f45cf2b675786f0ed24c8d04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Itu <itubusinesshub@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 12:07:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add ENTSO-E generation features to training pipeline

- database.py: add insert_generation() and get_generation_data() methods
- ingest.py: fix _ingest_generation() to actually store records; add _backfill_generation()
- features.py: add 22 generation-derived features (wind/solar/total gen lags, rolling stats, price ratios)
- run_training.py: load generation data from DB, merge with prices+weather, support both DB schemas
- forecast_service.py: include generation data in prediction-time feature building
- backfill_generation.py: standalone script for ENTSO-E historical data backfill

Feature count with generation data: ~110 (up from ~97)
